{"name": "Blood Scrawl", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5182480/extras_big/818a62ab2c58fcd91ff2ad43cdc3ec20.webp?t=1793748416\" height=\"503\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5182480/extras/818a62ab2c58fcd91ff2ad43cdc3ec20.avif?t=1793748416\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"96\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5182480/extras/d2eb347dad8220b06cb74242d4ccd564.avif?t=1793748416\" width=\"1256\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5182480/extras/02749bbd354a61602a44b271afce915a.poster.avif?t=1793748416\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5182480/extras/02749bbd354a61602a44b271afce915a.webm?t=1793748416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5182480/extras/02749bbd354a61602a44b271afce915a.mp4?t=1793748416\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Directional Melee Combat: </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Deliver death to your foes with fluid, tactical combat that uses your input direction to strike from different angles and foil their strikes with well-timed, well-directed blocks and parries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"96\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5182480/extras/d2eb347dad8220b06cb74242d4ccd564.avif?t=1793748416\" width=\"1256\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5182480/extras/1da41bcc3880f972407602c3eea2da53.poster.avif?t=1793748416\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5182480/extras/1da41bcc3880f972407602c3eea2da53.webm?t=1793748416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5182480/extras/1da41bcc3880f972407602c3eea2da53.mp4?t=1793748416\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Epic Boss Encounters: </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Face a myriad of unique boss duels where your skill is tested, and your mettle is forged. Show true mastery by not only defeating, but dominating your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"96\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5182480/extras/d2eb347dad8220b06cb74242d4ccd564.avif?t=1793748416\" width=\"1256\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5182480/extras/0da59f60cf87647f5e41599fde89ac64.poster.avif?t=1793748416\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5182480/extras/0da59f60cf87647f5e41599fde89ac64.webm?t=1793748416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5182480/extras/0da59f60cf87647f5e41599fde89ac64.mp4?t=1793748416\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>An Endless Hanging Library:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong>Each life and run takes you through the halls of the Hanging Library, an ever-changing maze of tomes, scrolls, and foes. Build your power and your skill, face the dangers of the corrupted archive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"96\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5182480/extras/d2eb347dad8220b06cb74242d4ccd564.avif?t=1793748416\" width=\"1256\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5182480/extras/40e43aa58151509b9d6ba7431ba5de7b.poster.avif?t=1793748416\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5182480/extras/40e43aa58151509b9d6ba7431ba5de7b.webm?t=1793748416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5182480/extras/40e43aa58151509b9d6ba7431ba5de7b.mp4?t=1793748416\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Armor, Armaments, and Buildcraft:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Customize your build with armor and weapons, tailoring your power to your play style. Collect character and equipment upgrades to buff yourself and your gear. Death is not the end. After death, your unique build spawns enemies in future runs that can be overcome, allowing for armaments and boons to be recovered and incorporated into new builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"96\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5182480/extras/d2eb347dad8220b06cb74242d4ccd564.avif?t=1793748416\" width=\"1256\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5182480/extras/4990bdc7ff95a517e36603d55e4324c6.poster.avif?t=1793748416\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5182480/extras/4990bdc7ff95a517e36603d55e4324c6.webm?t=1793748416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5182480/extras/4990bdc7ff95a517e36603d55e4324c6.mp4?t=1793748416\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Seek the Blue Flame: </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover a truth bound in blood at the heart of the Hanging Library. A corrupting scrawl twists the hearts and minds of all who read its wretched words. Will you face these lies and give light to truth or fall to the corrupting forces and in doing so, gain power unimagined?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"96\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5182480/extras/d2eb347dad8220b06cb74242d4ccd564.avif?t=1793748416\" width=\"1256\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Blood Scrawl is an action roguelite featuring a unique directional combat system. Explore the depths of an endless gothic library fighting the keepers driven mad by the corrupting scrawl. Discover artifact and pages from ancient tomes to customize your build and dominate your foes.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5182480/78e6b6674c21ce080f58e1f13e98e2dc0283e91c/header.jpg?t=1793748416", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Adventure", "RPG", "Action Roguelike", "Action-Adventure", "Dungeon Crawler"], "developers": "Soulware", "publishers": "Soulware", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "5182480", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "3 November 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/xLOk4FeTuWY", "first_seen": 1793660400.0, "review_rank": 43}